(1372987, 175385, 35044, '<td valign="top">normally I am immune to cuteness - I will make an exception here.  Great choice if subject and composition.  background is a tiny bit distracting - overexposed and too much detail.  Slightly too much detail in foreground.  Think that a small DoF would have worked wonders here.  I still like a lot.</td>', 'normally I am immune to cuteness - I will make an exception here.  Great choice if subject and composition.  background is a tiny bit distracting - overexposed and too much detail.  Slightly too much detail in foreground.  Think that a small DoF would have worked wonders here.  I still like a lot.', '2005-05-09 10:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
