(1372991, 175101, 35044, '<td valign="top">I have taken a shot of City Point in London that looks very similar to this.  Should have thought to retake it, as I like this.  Only criticisms are slight tilt to the right and slight lack of detail, but very hard to achieve on 640 x640.  Might have retained detail by losing the unnecessary frame and slightly tighter crop.</td>', 'I have taken a shot of City Point in London that looks very similar to this.  Should have thought to retake it, as I like this.  Only criticisms are slight tilt to the right and slight lack of detail, but very hard to achieve on 640 x640.  Might have retained detail by losing the unnecessary frame and slightly tighter crop.', '2005-05-09 10:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1372993, 175598, 35044, '<td valign="top">Cannot decide if this is perhaps too busy.  Strong central element may not have needed so much in the surrounding area.  Still like a lot.</td>', 'Cannot decide if this is perhaps too busy.  Strong central element may not have needed so much in the surrounding area.  Still like a lot.', '2005-05-09 10:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
