(1373182, 175492, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a very difficult task with such a large  range of light intensities.  Great job in not blowing out the highlights.  I like the composition as well.  I  wonder if you would have gotten more detail in the shadows with the sun behind you.  A 6.<br/></td>', 'This is a very difficult task with such a large  range of light intensities.  Great job in not blowing out the highlights.  I like the composition as well.  I  wonder if you would have gotten more detail in the shadows with the sun behind you.  A 6.', '2005-05-09 12:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373185, 175631, 21202, '<td valign="top">While you have avoided one of the main difficulties of taking a shot from the outside looking in, that of reflections on the glass, you fell into the problem of photographing in a dark area with an exceedingly bright background.  You could have easily solved this problem by turning your truck around.  A 4.</td>', 'While you have avoided one of the main difficulties of taking a shot from the outside looking in, that of reflections on the glass, you fell into the problem of photographing in a dark area with an exceedingly bright background.  You could have easily solved this problem by turning your truck around.  A 4.', '2005-05-09 12:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
