(1373196, 175644, 21202, '<td valign="top">This shot required manual focus, and you did well  with that.  The motion of the bat and ball are pluses.   The depth of field and color are very good.  The lighting available has limited the impact of this shot.  A 6.</td>', 'This shot required manual focus, and you did well  with that.  The motion of the bat and ball are pluses.   The depth of field and color are very good.  The lighting available has limited the impact of this shot.  A 6.', '2005-05-09 12:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
