(1373798, 173927, 24454, '<td valign="top">Looks very striking.  Nice colors that contrast great with the black.   I like it a lot!</td>', 'Looks very striking.  Nice colors that contrast great with the black.   I like it a lot!', '2005-05-09 17:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
