(1373806, 174718, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ahhhhhh. . . . sweet memories from childhood!   And the smile on her face looks like she is appreciating the innocence of chasing fireflies as well.  I like it a lot.</td>', 'Ahhhhhh. . . . sweet memories from childhood!   And the smile on her face looks like she is appreciating the innocence of chasing fireflies as well.  I like it a lot.', '2005-05-09 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1373808, 175662, 28623, '<td valign="top">This photograph is so beautiful!!! You have won first place in my opinion.<br/>Please tell me somebody adopted this beautiful little dog!  My God! Look at those eyes.</td>', 'This photograph is so beautiful!!! You have won first place in my opinion.Please tell me somebody adopted this beautiful little dog!  My God! Look at those eyes.', '2005-05-09 17:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
