(1373816, 175797, 28623, '<td valign="top">Great picture!  Makes me want to put a blue checkered tablecloth and tulips on my kitchen table by the window.   Your shadow is a distraction, but I really didn''t notice it  until I looked at it a second time.  Don''t know how it could have been avoided.</td>', 'Great picture!  Makes me want to put a blue checkered tablecloth and tulips on my kitchen table by the window.   Your shadow is a distraction, but I really didn''t notice it  until I looked at it a second time.  Don''t know how it could have been avoided.', '2005-05-09 17:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
