(1374023, 174717, 35804, '<td valign="top">Great title...love that shiny wallpaper...it''s gives the photo a nice rhythm. The tonality is very pretty and the kitty looks so silky...really nice composition...the "grain" is very appropriate for this picture...and without the toilet tank..this would NOT be the same! That totally makes it for me, adds that bit of humor. Alot people can''t stand "bathroom" pics, to me it''s just another room that can at times can yield very interesting and sometimes humorous pictures.</td>', 'Great title...love that shiny wallpaper...it''s gives the photo a nice rhythm. The tonality is very pretty and the kitty looks so silky...really nice composition...the "grain" is very appropriate for this picture...and without the toilet tank..this would NOT be the same! That totally makes it for me, adds that bit of humor. Alot people can''t stand "bathroom" pics, to me it''s just another room that can at times can yield very interesting and sometimes humorous pictures.', '2005-05-09 20:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374028, 175760, 35804, '<td valign="top">The light in this picture is absolutely exquisite...my eyes are immediately drawn to the interior wall where the light seems slightly richer/ warmer...a nice warm picture...makes me want to be there.</td>', 'The light in this picture is absolutely exquisite...my eyes are immediately drawn to the interior wall where the light seems slightly richer/ warmer...a nice warm picture...makes me want to be there.', '2005-05-09 20:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
