(1374362, 175603, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot, and the view from outside the flower is very nice. I''d wish for a higher angle though, to get more of the yellow and perhaps more detail on the insect.</td>', 'Nice macro shot, and the view from outside the flower is very nice. I''d wish for a higher angle though, to get more of the yellow and perhaps more detail on the insect.', '2005-05-09 23:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
