(1374373, 175568, 34247, '<td valign="top">the image seems a little strange to me, particularly due to focus reasons. the back is sharp, but the neck isn''t. The head, which is perhaps the same distance more or less from the camera as the neck seems to be hyper sharpened, with tufts of hair both blurred and boosted. In terms of composition, the right bottom corner where the frame of the window cuts in, I feel that this element is a distraction. It''s a very nice idea for the challenge, and I''d have rated higher but for the aforementioned focus perceptions I had. 5</td>', 'the image seems a little strange to me, particularly due to focus reasons. the back is sharp, but the neck isn''t. The head, which is perhaps the same distance more or less from the camera as the neck seems to be hyper sharpened, with tufts of hair both blurred and boosted. In terms of composition, the right bottom corner where the frame of the window cuts in, I feel that this element is a distraction. It''s a very nice idea for the challenge, and I''d have rated higher but for the aforementioned focus perceptions I had. 5', '2005-05-09 23:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
