(1374389, 175517, 6519, '<td valign="top">What on earth am I looking at here? I can not make sense of this at all. This will drive me nuts now until next weekend  :-(</td>', 'What on earth am I looking at here? I can not make sense of this at all. This will drive me nuts now until next weekend  :-(', '2005-05-09 23:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374394, 175793, 6519, '<td valign="top">This would have been perfect if the dog appeared to be looking at the lady instead of the sky. I still haven''t figured out how this was done legally.</td>', 'This would have been perfect if the dog appeared to be looking at the lady instead of the sky. I still haven''t figured out how this was done legally.', '2005-05-09 23:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374395, 175534, 34247, '<td valign="top">I suspect people might be marking this down because technically it''s not a "look inside." I like this shot, and I feel it''s entirely within the spirit. I reckon it''s not easy to get the right tones for the reflection on the glass. I like the juxtapositioning between the square/rectangles of the high rise behind and the curves of the foreground elements. I think to achieve this shot, the lighting must have been well considered. The bottom I''d have cropped a little higher to block out that horizontal line of separation, and maybe I''d have played a bit with oversharpening to bring out more textures on the vertical columns. 7</td>', 'I suspect people might be marking this down because technically it''s not a "look inside." I like this shot, and I feel it''s entirely within the spirit. I reckon it''s not easy to get the right tones for the reflection on the glass. I like the juxtapositioning between the square/rectangles of the high rise behind and the curves of the foreground elements. I think to achieve this shot, the lighting must have been well considered. The bottom I''d have cropped a little higher to block out that horizontal line of separation, and maybe I''d have played a bit with oversharpening to bring out more textures on the vertical columns. 7', '2005-05-09 23:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374397, 175232, 6519, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but it would have worked much better if the fence was blurred, and the garden on the other side was in focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, but it would have worked much better if the fence was blurred, and the garden on the other side was in focus.', '2005-05-09 23:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374400, 175799, 34247, '<td valign="top">very nice thinking and the keyhole "shadow" was rendered nicely. For this to work better, for me, however, I''d want more details and sharpness on the pupil. Perhaps sharpen, saturate on that part would be very effective for the image.</td>', 'very nice thinking and the keyhole "shadow" was rendered nicely. For this to work better, for me, however, I''d want more details and sharpness on the pupil. Perhaps sharpen, saturate on that part would be very effective for the image.', '2005-05-09 23:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374407, 175495, 34247, '<td valign="top">the focus feels soft all around. I like the idea here, and the color schemes of the inside elements has lots of potential. But the focus lets the image down, I feel, and the bottom crop can be higher to isolate the glass wall a bit more.</td>', 'the focus feels soft all around. I like the idea here, and the color schemes of the inside elements has lots of potential. But the focus lets the image down, I feel, and the bottom crop can be higher to isolate the glass wall a bit more.', '2005-05-09 23:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374410, 175517, 3724, '<td valign="top">great subject........</td>', 'great subject........', '2005-05-09 23:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374413, 175013, 6519, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. For the sake of the challenge, a day time shot would have done, too, but having the light like this has added so much to the photo. Lovely atmosphere. A little less of the foreground right down the bottom would make the composition even better.</td>', 'This is lovely. For the sake of the challenge, a day time shot would have done, too, but having the light like this has added so much to the photo. Lovely atmosphere. A little less of the foreground right down the bottom would make the composition even better.', '2005-05-09 23:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374417, 175568, 34763, '<td valign="top">Makes one wonder who really is in charge. Greta contrast while maintaining detail. The feathers on it''s back are so clear. Great work.10</td>', 'Makes one wonder who really is in charge. Greta contrast while maintaining detail. The feathers on it''s back are so clear. Great work.10', '2005-05-09 23:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374418, 174718, 34247, '<td valign="top">Great reflection and luminosity on the eyes. the dark blue part of the background, between the face and the jar is giving me issues, and I generally feel a simpler darker and uniformly toned background would have been more effective. the blurry and reflective jar top also distracts, imho. But very nice thinking behind the shot. 6</td>', 'Great reflection and luminosity on the eyes. the dark blue part of the background, between the face and the jar is giving me issues, and I generally feel a simpler darker and uniformly toned background would have been more effective. the blurry and reflective jar top also distracts, imho. But very nice thinking behind the shot. 6', '2005-05-09 23:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374425, 174289, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like the eyes and pupil work, but the lighting seems harsh and tosses out some harsh shadowing. I''d have cropped higher, taking out the nostril. But like the shot enough...</td>', 'I like the eyes and pupil work, but the lighting seems harsh and tosses out some harsh shadowing. I''d have cropped higher, taking out the nostril. But like the shot enough...', '2005-05-10 00:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374427, 175751, 6519, '<td valign="top">Fantastic! I love the statue, and I commend you for thinking of it. I bet you made a special trip to that museum (?) as soon as you read the challenge description. I also like the angle of the photo. Great shot. 8</td>', 'Fantastic! I love the statue, and I commend you for thinking of it. I bet you made a special trip to that museum (?) as soon as you read the challenge description. I also like the angle of the photo. Great shot. 8', '2005-05-10 00:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374433, 175379, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like how the light permeates through the plastic and creates a soft atmosphere inside the bag. the choice to maintain the bag details as a strong, colorful element is also an interesting one. But I''d wish for more focus sharpness on the pretzels themselves. A little tighter crop on the right hand side would have taken care of that corner of the bag and the bit of very rectangular shadow on the bottom right, which I think is a point of distraction.</td>', 'I like how the light permeates through the plastic and creates a soft atmosphere inside the bag. the choice to maintain the bag details as a strong, colorful element is also an interesting one. But I''d wish for more focus sharpness on the pretzels themselves. A little tighter crop on the right hand side would have taken care of that corner of the bag and the bit of very rectangular shadow on the bottom right, which I think is a point of distraction.', '2005-05-10 00:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374436, 174658, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand the purpose of this. I keep telling myself that I"m outside the cup looking in, but everything inside me says NO, those two are inside, looking out. Go figure.... not sure what to make of this.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand the purpose of this. I keep telling myself that I"m outside the cup looking in, but everything inside me says NO, those two are inside, looking out. Go figure.... not sure what to make of this.', '2005-05-10 00:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374444, 174736, 6519, '<td valign="top">I find the lighting very flat, but I love the character of the old hat and old window frame.</td>', 'I find the lighting very flat, but I love the character of the old hat and old window frame.', '2005-05-10 00:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374455, 175808, 34247, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. Black specks on the eyelid and below the eyelashes, as well as a single dot on the left side of the frame present distraction points for me. There''s also a light issue on the pupil itself, but very nice idea being expressed overall.</td>', 'Interesting image. Black specks on the eyelid and below the eyelashes, as well as a single dot on the left side of the frame present distraction points for me. There''s also a light issue on the pupil itself, but very nice idea being expressed overall.', '2005-05-10 00:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374493, 175608, 21202, '<td valign="top">I don''t get what is going on here.  A 4.</td>', 'I don''t get what is going on here.  A 4.', '2005-05-10 00:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374507, 175741, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a difficult image to understand.   The lighting and paint colors are nice.  A 5.</td>', 'This is a difficult image to understand.   The lighting and paint colors are nice.  A 5.', '2005-05-10 00:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374513, 174941, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a nice job.  I think it would meet more of the actual complexites possible to this challenge if we could see the inside also and not have the view of the inside completely drowned out by reflections of the outside.  A 7.</td>', 'This is a nice job.  I think it would meet more of the actual complexites possible to this challenge if we could see the inside also and not have the view of the inside completely drowned out by reflections of the outside.  A 7.', '2005-05-10 00:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374514, 174809, 21202, '<td valign="top">If this picture were taken later in the evening, the outside and inside lighting would be more balanced and the inside detals would be clearer.  A 6.</td>', 'If this picture were taken later in the evening, the outside and inside lighting would be more balanced and the inside detals would be clearer.  A 6.', '2005-05-10 00:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374522, 175630, 21202, '<td valign="top">Having the backlighting helps in seeing into the tunnel, as well as the interior lights.  If this shot were taken closer to dark, there would be more of a balance between external and internal light.  A 5.</td>', 'Having the backlighting helps in seeing into the tunnel, as well as the interior lights.  If this shot were taken closer to dark, there would be more of a balance between external and internal light.  A 5.', '2005-05-10 01:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374524, 175444, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is a nice macro.  It does stretch the terms outside and inside somewhat as I would not describe the position where the camera is as outsitde the flower in normal conversation.  A 6.</td>', 'This is a nice macro.  It does stretch the terms outside and inside somewhat as I would not describe the position where the camera is as outsitde the flower in normal conversation.  A 6.', '2005-05-10 01:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374529, 175804, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot.  I am assuming you used a polarizing filter to eliminate reflections.  You did well to get as much light on the face of the driver as you did with the light coming mainly from above.  An 8.</td>', 'This is an excellent shot.  I am assuming you used a polarizing filter to eliminate reflections.  You did well to get as much light on the face of the driver as you did with the light coming mainly from above.  An 8.', '2005-05-10 01:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374531, 175603, 21202, '<td valign="top">This would be more outside the flower looking in than another shot I just passed where the camera was directly above the flower.  Nice macro, nice bee.  Maybe the light is a little to strong for the delicacy of a flower?   A 7.</td>', 'This would be more outside the flower looking in than another shot I just passed where the camera was directly above the flower.  Nice macro, nice bee.  Maybe the light is a little to strong for the delicacy of a flower?   A 7.', '2005-05-10 01:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374533, 175495, 21202, '<td valign="top">This was my understanding of the challenge as well.  Good interior lighting and good balance between internal and external light.  Picture on office wall adds human interest.  An  8.</td>', 'This was my understanding of the challenge as well.  Good interior lighting and good balance between internal and external light.  Picture on office wall adds human interest.  An  8.', '2005-05-10 01:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374540, 175792, 21202, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better with a longer range lens or larger aperture to defocus the background.  Having the  door open helped alot.   The sky was pretty uncooperative.  A 5.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better with a longer range lens or larger aperture to defocus the background.  Having the  door open helped alot.   The sky was pretty uncooperative.  A 5.', '2005-05-10 01:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374549, 175615, 13772, '<td valign="top">Reflective glass? Pretty cool shot! Good luck.</td>', 'Reflective glass? Pretty cool shot! Good luck.', '2005-05-10 01:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374550, 174183, 21202, '<td valign="top">I seem to have a lot less trouble with outside and inside on this shot than I have had with similar pictures of the insides of flowers.  I believe it is because you have given a balanced treatment to the outside and inside.  The juxtaposition of concave and convex provides interesting comparisons.  The translucency on the right hand side provides some sparkle and life.  An 8.</td>', 'I seem to have a lot less trouble with outside and inside on this shot than I have had with similar pictures of the insides of flowers.  I believe it is because you have given a balanced treatment to the outside and inside.  The juxtaposition of concave and convex provides interesting comparisons.  The translucency on the right hand side provides some sparkle and life.  An 8.', '2005-05-10 01:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1374553, 174432, 21202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful metaphor.  A 10.</td>', 'Beautiful metaphor.  A 10.', '2005-05-10 01:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
