(1377148, 175339, 28742, '<td valign="top">LOL - sorry, at first glance, I thought the title said "Rectal Room" - good thing you didn''t typo it that way. ;-)<br/> <br/>Nice job technically, but would be more interesting with people in the room.</td>', 'LOL - sorry, at first glance, I thought the title said "Rectal Room" - good thing you didn''t typo it that way. ;-) Nice job technically, but would be more interesting with people in the room.', '2005-05-11 02:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
