(1378800, 173135, 23653, '<td valign="top">this is funny....8</td>', 'this is funny....8', '2005-05-11 14:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378808, 175615, 2490, '<td valign="top">This is deep, and it''s good art.  I just don''t like the photo, sorry.  Indeed, emotionally provoking, but the thoughts are not clear.  The message doesn''t grab me, it just makes me curious.  What are you trying to tell us about here?</td>', 'This is deep, and it''s good art.  I just don''t like the photo, sorry.  Indeed, emotionally provoking, but the thoughts are not clear.  The message doesn''t grab me, it just makes me curious.  What are you trying to tell us about here?', '2005-05-11 14:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378887, 174177, 2490, '<td valign="top">The date stamp is really hurting you here :(</td>', 'The date stamp is really hurting you here :(', '2005-05-11 14:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378891, 175665, 2490, '<td valign="top">Would be really a great shot, but the focus feels soft.</td>', 'Would be really a great shot, but the focus feels soft.', '2005-05-11 14:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378906, 175558, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a great deal. The lighting is very nicely done and the reflection is very nice as well. the blue-ish color tone works well with the glass, and in terms of challenge theme, it''s right on the head. 9. Bumping to 10, to fit my voting curve :)</td>', 'I like this shot a great deal. The lighting is very nicely done and the reflection is very nice as well. the blue-ish color tone works well with the glass, and in terms of challenge theme, it''s right on the head. 9. Bumping to 10, to fit my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378908, 175633, 34247, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Great focus clarity, nice management of the available light, great crop. the scratches on the glass is perfect, and I don''t even mind the reflection. I''ll do a 9 here. Bumping to 10 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'I love this shot. Great focus clarity, nice management of the available light, great crop. the scratches on the glass is perfect, and I don''t even mind the reflection. I''ll do a 9 here. Bumping to 10 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378909, 175574, 34247, '<td valign="top">great lighting control, nice focus on the shell and yolk. the shell particularly is luminous, and nicely textured. background choice is right on to emphasize both the whites and oranges of the subject. 8. Bumping to 10 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'great lighting control, nice focus on the shell and yolk. the shell particularly is luminous, and nicely textured. background choice is right on to emphasize both the whites and oranges of the subject. 8. Bumping to 10 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378910, 175666, 34247, '<td valign="top">great texture on the wall and tree, and nice selective desat/oversat. the black wall on the right hand side works well to emphasize the burst of color. 8. Bumping to 10 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'great texture on the wall and tree, and nice selective desat/oversat. the black wall on the right hand side works well to emphasize the burst of color. 8. Bumping to 10 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378911, 175525, 34247, '<td valign="top">I think this is an excellent composition with nice lighting and detailing work. I''m not so sure about the soft, neat-imaged look. I feel this would be effective left a bit raw, with some grain work apparent in the image. 7, but would have scored higher without the softness. Bump to 9 as I''m adjusting for challenge curve</td>', 'I think this is an excellent composition with nice lighting and detailing work. I''m not so sure about the soft, neat-imaged look. I feel this would be effective left a bit raw, with some grain work apparent in the image. 7, but would have scored higher without the softness. Bump to 9 as I''m adjusting for challenge curve', '2005-05-11 15:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378913, 175751, 34247, '<td valign="top">Bumping to 9 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'Bumping to 9 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378916, 175539, 34247, '<td valign="top">Another very nice silhouette in this challenge. Curiosity comes across, nice definition on the figures, nice lighting. Bumping to 9 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'Another very nice silhouette in this challenge. Curiosity comes across, nice definition on the figures, nice lighting. Bumping to 9 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378918, 175021, 34247, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette :) The composition is very nice, the lights along the wall add a lot to the composition. For more effect, I think, the model should be closer to the photog, creating a larger and more dramatic view. 7. Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'Nice silhouette :) The composition is very nice, the lights along the wall add a lot to the composition. For more effect, I think, the model should be closer to the photog, creating a larger and more dramatic view. 7. Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
