(1378922, 173236, 34247, '<td valign="top">great facial catch on the water drops. Like this image quite a bit, and the planning and thinking is evident. 7. Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'great facial catch on the water drops. Like this image quite a bit, and the planning and thinking is evident. 7. Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
