(1378926, 175259, 34247, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. a creepy eyeballish effect for me. can''t wait to read more about the setup. 7. Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :) as well as to fit the 8ball.</td>', 'I like this shot. a creepy eyeballish effect for me. can''t wait to read more about the setup. 7. Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :) as well as to fit the 8ball.', '2005-05-11 15:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378927, 175176, 34247, '<td valign="top">Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378930, 174784, 34247, '<td valign="top">one of my personal favorites in terms of composition so far. Love the textures and the black and white choice. I feel the top is a bit over exposed though, and the lack of similar textures on those areas is a bit of a let down. Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'one of my personal favorites in terms of composition so far. Love the textures and the black and white choice. I feel the top is a bit over exposed though, and the lack of similar textures on those areas is a bit of a let down. Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378931, 175517, 37617, '<td valign="top">i love the tricks the wood plays with the eyes.. very interesting.  reminds me a little of the film "black hole"...</td>', 'i love the tricks the wood plays with the eyes.. very interesting.  reminds me a little of the film "black hole"...', '2005-05-11 15:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378934, 175490, 34247, '<td valign="top">nice perspective/composition, like the details on the wood. throw the doors more wide open increase light source a bit, and meter for it, and you''d have yourself a nice silhouette for the next challenge, too. Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'nice perspective/composition, like the details on the wood. throw the doors more wide open increase light source a bit, and meter for it, and you''d have yourself a nice silhouette for the next challenge, too. Bumping to 8 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378935, 174177, 13026, '<td valign="top">the date in the corner is distracting</td>', 'the date in the corner is distracting', '2005-05-11 15:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378936, 175475, 34247, '<td valign="top">slight off focus on the rim of the pepper lessens the impact of this otherwise very nice composition. The background choice is nice, the details of the inside is good. The lighting is very good. But again, focus is one issue here. Bumping to 7 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'slight off focus on the rim of the pepper lessens the impact of this otherwise very nice composition. The background choice is nice, the details of the inside is good. The lighting is very good. But again, focus is one issue here. Bumping to 7 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378939, 173233, 34247, '<td valign="top">I really like how the glass panels warp the faces. The clothing adds a lot of feel to the image, and the color tones are very nice. the crop lets this image down, i feel, as i''m wanting to get a closer look and a tighter crop on the window, which is itself infinitely more interesting than the other parts of the image. Such details on the window frame, and I really wish this was a closer look. Bumping to 7 to fix my voting curve :)</td>', 'I really like how the glass panels warp the faces. The clothing adds a lot of feel to the image, and the color tones are very nice. the crop lets this image down, i feel, as i''m wanting to get a closer look and a tighter crop on the window, which is itself infinitely more interesting than the other parts of the image. Such details on the window frame, and I really wish this was a closer look. Bumping to 7 to fix my voting curve :)', '2005-05-11 15:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1378941, 175567, 34247, '<td valign="top">my first grab on this is occupied by the face, which seems plasticky, either neat imaged a bit much or another post-processing method. I like the concept, and the multicolored box invites attention. The focus of the eyes is right on, as well, and the gentle lighting coming off the box onto the face is very nice. But I''m also picking up on the left hand, pinky finger, and the slight burst of light there, which I think is a bit of a distraction. I''m also not quite sure about the "fog" from the box. 7</td>', 'my first grab on this is occupied by the face, which seems plasticky, either neat imaged a bit much or another post-processing method. I like the concept, and the multicolored box invites attention. The focus of the eyes is right on, as well, and the gentle lighting coming off the box onto the face is very nice. But I''m also picking up on the left hand, pinky finger, and the slight burst of light there, which I think is a bit of a distraction. I''m also not quite sure about the "fog" from the box. 7', '2005-05-11 15:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379243, 174888, 35804, '<td valign="top">Neato creative!...and funny to boot.  : }</td>', 'Neato creative!...and funny to boot.  : }', '2005-05-11 16:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379260, 175798, 35804, '<td valign="top">Great picture...love the red glow, the light in general. That little skeleton statue at the bottom left totally makes this for me...the obscurity of the sign is also really effective...it''s all so mysterious with a pinch of sinister</td>', 'Great picture...love the red glow, the light in general. That little skeleton statue at the bottom left totally makes this for me...the obscurity of the sign is also really effective...it''s all so mysterious with a pinch of sinister', '2005-05-11 16:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379269, 174592, 35804, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and texture.</td>', 'Beautiful light and texture.', '2005-05-11 16:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379278, 175736, 35804, '<td valign="top">Holy crap I hate when that happens!  : }   What a great entry, funny too! Big points for makin'' me laugh!</td>', 'Holy crap I hate when that happens!  : }   What a great entry, funny too! Big points for makin'' me laugh!', '2005-05-11 16:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379290, 174690, 35804, '<td valign="top">This has a really nice nostalgic appeal with a touch of wistful dreamyness. The light if gorgeous...that bit of aqua adds contrasts nicely with the white and black...it all makes me think of the beach.</td>', 'This has a really nice nostalgic appeal with a touch of wistful dreamyness. The light if gorgeous...that bit of aqua adds contrasts nicely with the white and black...it all makes me think of the beach.', '2005-05-11 16:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379465, 175259, 3032, '<td valign="top">Reflections on the ball add a lot of depth, great shot.</td>', 'Reflections on the ball add a lot of depth, great shot.', '2005-05-11 17:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379471, 175598, 3032, '<td valign="top">One big mess of lines (shadows) and angles, I love it!<br/>Confusing but entertaining, one of those photos that make you stop and look a bit longer. Fav for the challenge.</td>', 'One big mess of lines (shadows) and angles, I love it!Confusing but entertaining, one of those photos that make you stop and look a bit longer. Fav for the challenge.', '2005-05-11 17:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
