(1379703, 174784, 37391, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot in black and white.  I don''t think it would be nearly as good in color.</td>', 'I really like this shot in black and white.  I don''t think it would be nearly as good in color.', '2005-05-11 19:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379706, 175495, 32848, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but was this meant to be out of focus?</td>', 'I''m sorry, but was this meant to be out of focus?', '2005-05-11 19:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379917, 175615, 35804, '<td valign="top">The title leads me to believe this is an erotic type of family picture? That''s just kinda icky pervy.<br/> <br/>I''m back...this photo is like one of those songs that will not get out of your head...some say titles are not important, I am not one of those people. A title can lead, influence, define, or merely just label what we are looking at...I kept thinking how much this picture would change if the title were different...what if it were called "Wife" "Nextdoor" "Exhibit" "Watching" "Temptation"?( I''m not suggesting you to change the title at all just, thinking out loud.) I like how the "meaning" of this picture would change...You have boldly labeled this "Sister"...very provacative...uncomfortable...completely demonstrates how a title can spin a picture. Bumping this way up for being bold and provacative...also, just thought of this, for some reason I assumed the photgrapher is male...I could me completely wrong! Why would I assume this? Just because it''s a nude? The reflection of a man? Such a great "loaded" complex image! I''ll leave ya alone now.   : }</td>', 'The title leads me to believe this is an erotic type of family picture? That''s just kinda icky pervy. I''m back...this photo is like one of those songs that will not get out of your head...some say titles are not important, I am not one of those people. A title can lead, influence, define, or merely just label what we are looking at...I kept thinking how much this picture would change if the title were different...what if it were called "Wife" "Nextdoor" "Exhibit" "Watching" "Temptation"?( I''m not suggesting you to change the title at all just, thinking out loud.) I like how the "meaning" of this picture would change...You have boldly labeled this "Sister"...very provacative...uncomfortable...completely demonstrates how a title can spin a picture. Bumping this way up for being bold and provacative...also, just thought of this, for some reason I assumed the photgrapher is male...I could me completely wrong! Why would I assume this? Just because it''s a nude? The reflection of a man? Such a great "loaded" complex image! I''ll leave ya alone now.   : }', '2005-05-11 21:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379920, 175539, 35804, '<td valign="top">The picture really effects me due to pleasant memories I have. My Grandfather was a total aviation nut and always took me around to "see the planes". Thanks for making me think of him and some very cherished memories. Also, I love the simplicity of the image, just really nicely made.</td>', 'The picture really effects me due to pleasant memories I have. My Grandfather was a total aviation nut and always took me around to "see the planes". Thanks for making me think of him and some very cherished memories. Also, I love the simplicity of the image, just really nicely made.', '2005-05-11 21:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379924, 174468, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is just a really cool image...hits the carnival atmosphere just right. The bright balloons contrasted against the dangling prizes is great...then to the right we have the the guy who runs the game. I like how he is half obscured by shadow... makes it all seem a little shifty. The harsh light is also perfect, just really nicely done.</td>', 'This is just a really cool image...hits the carnival atmosphere just right. The bright balloons contrasted against the dangling prizes is great...then to the right we have the the guy who runs the game. I like how he is half obscured by shadow... makes it all seem a little shifty. The harsh light is also perfect, just really nicely done.', '2005-05-11 21:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1379927, 175146, 35804, '<td valign="top">I love going to events similar to the one pictured here...for me it''s HotsRods and Kustom cars...they seem to be so ripe for picture taking. Love the "grit" of the picture and the contrast is beautiful...totally adds to the atmosphere. Super nice.</td>', 'I love going to events similar to the one pictured here...for me it''s HotsRods and Kustom cars...they seem to be so ripe for picture taking. Love the "grit" of the picture and the contrast is beautiful...totally adds to the atmosphere. Super nice.', '2005-05-11 21:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380059, 175558, 11895, '<td valign="top">very clear and nicely detailed, I think this is the kind the dpc voters really like, looks just a bit oversharpened at some points but that''s nit picking, hope it does well for you</td>', 'very clear and nicely detailed, I think this is the kind the dpc voters really like, looks just a bit oversharpened at some points but that''s nit picking, hope it does well for you', '2005-05-11 22:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380230, 175300, 11895, '<td valign="top">maybe not over exposed but the way the edges of the box on the left and bottom are faded out is a problem, you have taken too much out of the whites and left no detail, otherwise a very interesting shot with good colors and depth of field</td>', 'maybe not over exposed but the way the edges of the box on the left and bottom are faded out is a problem, you have taken too much out of the whites and left no detail, otherwise a very interesting shot with good colors and depth of field', '2005-05-12 00:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1380420, 175568, 27735, '<td valign="top">Very funny...excellent framing with the car door. 7</td>', 'Very funny...excellent framing with the car door. 7', '2005-05-12 02:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
