(1381745, 175377, 21202, '<td valign="top">You were quick to note the ambiguity of the challenge title and description.  This is a nice portrain of th bultures head,   My concern is that he can see far more looking out than we can looking in.  I feel that you have avoided the photographic challenge of photographing dark inner spaces from brightly lit outer spaces.  Also, pictorially, Much of the top of this picture adds nothing to it, and it could have also been framed to include less on both sides as well.  A 5.</td>', 'You were quick to note the ambiguity of the challenge title and description.  This is a nice portrain of th bultures head,   My concern is that he can see far more looking out than we can looking in.  I feel that you have avoided the photographic challenge of photographing dark inner spaces from brightly lit outer spaces.  Also, pictorially, Much of the top of this picture adds nothing to it, and it could have also been framed to include less on both sides as well.  A 5.', '2005-05-12 16:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381753, 174834, 21202, '<td valign="top">As the  outside is in darkness and the inside is advertised as paradise, I should rather have seen paradise than a dimly lit stone fence.  The iron work on the gate is interesting.  The pasture and trees on the inside not so much.  A 4.</td>', 'As the  outside is in darkness and the inside is advertised as paradise, I should rather have seen paradise than a dimly lit stone fence.  The iron work on the gate is interesting.  The pasture and trees on the inside not so much.  A 4.', '2005-05-12 16:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381757, 175801, 21202, '<td valign="top">You have met the challenge following the dark exterior, bright interior path.  While there ar a number of interesting items in the store window, they have not been arranged to achieve a compelling photographic composition.  A 6.</td>', 'You have met the challenge following the dark exterior, bright interior path.  While there ar a number of interesting items in the store window, they have not been arranged to achieve a compelling photographic composition.  A 6.', '2005-05-12 16:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381763, 175702, 21202, '<td valign="top">This room is very poorly lit.  A 3.  You might want to check your monitor settings.  By moving the light source on the right behind the door,  you could have exposed the picture more without the burn out that the light presents.  This would still not be a very thrilling composition.</td>', 'This room is very poorly lit.  A 3.  You might want to check your monitor settings.  By moving the light source on the right behind the door,  you could have exposed the picture more without the burn out that the light presents.  This would still not be a very thrilling composition.', '2005-05-12 16:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381764, 173135, 24065, '<td valign="top">Oh my!!  What an expression!</td>', 'Oh my!!  What an expression!', '2005-05-12 16:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381766, 173281, 21202, '<td valign="top">I do not like the blurred frameing and what is left, sems like to small a taste of a lovely yard.<br/> <br/>A 3.</td>', 'I do not like the blurred frameing and what is left, sems like to small a taste of a lovely yard. A 3.', '2005-05-12 16:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381768, 175662, 24065, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture! Very emotive.  My only suggestion for improvement would be to straighten it.  There is a way to crop for perspective in PSCS that would allow you to have all those lines straight.  8</td>', 'Wonderful capture! Very emotive.  My only suggestion for improvement would be to straighten it.  There is a way to crop for perspective in PSCS that would allow you to have all those lines straight.  8', '2005-05-12 16:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
