(1381786, 175525, 21202, '<td valign="top">This certainly is a nice candid shot showing a welcome neighbor checking in.   You have done well to retain light on the model''s face and front with the strong backlighting.  I think that while it is usually a compositional no no to split a picture in half vertically, it works to some extent here.  A7.</td>', 'This certainly is a nice candid shot showing a welcome neighbor checking in.   You have done well to retain light on the model''s face and front with the strong backlighting.  I think that while it is usually a compositional no no to split a picture in half vertically, it works to some extent here.  A7.', '2005-05-12 17:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1381793, 175613, 21202, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what is outside the tunnel looking into it.  The part of the picture that is well lit has very few pixels to represent it.  A 3.</td>', 'I have no idea what is outside the tunnel looking into it.  The part of the picture that is well lit has very few pixels to represent it.  A 3.', '2005-05-12 17:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
