(1381844, 174888, 21202, '<td valign="top">We would not usually cut someone''s head open in this manner to look  inside nor allow ours to be so cut off while gazing inside.  I would  also like to have somewhat of a peek inside myself.  It is somewhat interesting that left and right  halves are shown masked off with similar masks.  Good modeling by observer, nice intense look.  I assume you were both models and this is a dual strobed  single long exposure.  An 8 for creativity and execution.</td>', 'We would not usually cut someone''s head open in this manner to look  inside nor allow ours to be so cut off while gazing inside.  I would  also like to have somewhat of a peek inside myself.  It is somewhat interesting that left and right  halves are shown masked off with similar masks.  Good modeling by observer, nice intense look.  I assume you were both models and this is a dual strobed  single long exposure.  An 8 for creativity and execution.', '2005-05-12 17:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
