(1383663, 175606, 6814, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful nature shot.  The lighting is almost perfect and the colors are very nice.  I especiallly like all of the detail in the feathers.  Excellent!</td>', 'This is a beautiful nature shot.  The lighting is almost perfect and the colors are very nice.  I especiallly like all of the detail in the feathers.  Excellent!', '2005-05-13 12:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
