(1383890, 175793, 4967, '<td valign="top">This is adorable!!  I''m not sure how you did it... I"m guessing that everything but the dog is a photograph?  But it is very well done, and extremely cute.  Only thing I might mention is the reflection in the glass near the center of the photo is a bit distracting... otherwise I like it. Nicely done.</td>', 'This is adorable!!  I''m not sure how you did it... I"m guessing that everything but the dog is a photograph?  But it is very well done, and extremely cute.  Only thing I might mention is the reflection in the glass near the center of the photo is a bit distracting... otherwise I like it. Nicely done.', '2005-05-13 14:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1383894, 175251, 4967, '<td valign="top">Did you try this in black and white?  it might have been more effective?  Also although you might have gotten marked down for it, I think in this case, slightly blowing out the light might outside might have looked slightly more artistic.  Just some ideas to try.</td>', 'Did you try this in black and white?  it might have been more effective?  Also although you might have gotten marked down for it, I think in this case, slightly blowing out the light might outside might have looked slightly more artistic.  Just some ideas to try.', '2005-05-13 14:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1383903, 175385, 4967, '<td valign="top">Playing around with my browser a bit just to try some cropping, I almost feel like it might have been nice to have more off the top, just slightly leaving a bit of the tube (?) above the circle, giving it a slightly longer than rounder feel?  This is cute... I can''t tell - are these real or stuffed dogs?  No matter what I like the photo.  Good job with the exposure.</td>', 'Playing around with my browser a bit just to try some cropping, I almost feel like it might have been nice to have more off the top, just slightly leaving a bit of the tube (?) above the circle, giving it a slightly longer than rounder feel?  This is cute... I can''t tell - are these real or stuffed dogs?  No matter what I like the photo.  Good job with the exposure.', '2005-05-13 14:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1383906, 175468, 4967, '<td valign="top">I feel this could have been effective if it was a real bird, I like the softness of the curtain and the colors here, but the fact that it is pretty obviously a fake bird, really detracts from the photo for me.  It just looks too contrived.  Compositionally, lighting wise and color wise if you had a real bird I would have given you a very high score, but I am all for realism, I apologize, it just really bothers me.  I also like the hammock (?) in the background. Still a 7 but with a real bird - prolly would have gone 9 or 10</td>', 'I feel this could have been effective if it was a real bird, I like the softness of the curtain and the colors here, but the fact that it is pretty obviously a fake bird, really detracts from the photo for me.  It just looks too contrived.  Compositionally, lighting wise and color wise if you had a real bird I would have given you a very high score, but I am all for realism, I apologize, it just really bothers me.  I also like the hammock (?) in the background. Still a 7 but with a real bird - prolly would have gone 9 or 10', '2005-05-13 14:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1383910, 175607, 4967, '<td valign="top">Please please please don''t have added that frame in photoshop!  this is great :-) I really like it - it gives you an odd feeling.  I even like the gloomy sky.  I just really hope the frame was taken at the same time.</td>', 'Please please please don''t have added that frame in photoshop!  this is great :-) I really like it - it gives you an odd feeling.  I even like the gloomy sky.  I just really hope the frame was taken at the same time.', '2005-05-13 14:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
