(1385354, 175598, 33924, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing photograph! There are so many lines that could be competing with each other, but instead they frame the people so perfectly, and make a statement about the smallness of humanity within all of this technology we have. A classic!<br/></td>', 'This is an amazing photograph! There are so many lines that could be competing with each other, but instead they frame the people so perfectly, and make a statement about the smallness of humanity within all of this technology we have. A classic!', '2005-05-14 11:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385355, 173135, 33924, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph with a story to tell! The doorway frames the white cat very strongly. The red background is so powerful and serves to enhance the tense atmosphere. The 2 mafia cats seen only from the back bring a sinister feel to the picture. But it''s funny all at the same time. I love it!</td>', 'This is a great photograph with a story to tell! The doorway frames the white cat very strongly. The red background is so powerful and serves to enhance the tense atmosphere. The 2 mafia cats seen only from the back bring a sinister feel to the picture. But it''s funny all at the same time. I love it!', '2005-05-14 11:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1385358, 174432, 33924, '<td valign="top">What a powerful photo you''ve created, highlighting the issue of poverty. Your composition juxtaposes the French chocolates and the mother with her children perfectly. I think rotating the photo slightly clockwise and then cropping it so that it was parallel to the frame of the picture would be my only suggestion for change. 10</td>', 'What a powerful photo you''ve created, highlighting the issue of poverty. Your composition juxtaposes the French chocolates and the mother with her children perfectly. I think rotating the photo slightly clockwise and then cropping it so that it was parallel to the frame of the picture would be my only suggestion for change. 10', '2005-05-14 11:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
