(1387963, 175597, 27894, '<td valign="top">I would like to thank you four for commenting on my photo. Its funny how nothing in that shot is where its supposed to be. If you look at underneath the desk you can see her bed. Also added lighting to the room.<br/> <br/>also with the object above her head was placed their :). But i changed the position of the mirror and gave the object above her head the illusion as if it was growing out from her head.</td>', 'I would like to thank you four for commenting on my photo. Its funny how nothing in that shot is where its supposed to be. If you look at underneath the desk you can see her bed. Also added lighting to the room. also with the object above her head was placed their :). But i changed the position of the mirror and gave the object above her head the illusion as if it was growing out from her head.', '2005-05-16 02:38:26.000000', NULL, 0),
