(1390077, 173871, 24970, '<td valign="top">What? No comments? I''m very confused about the non-reaction to this photo. It''s decently in focus, composed well, and best of all -  a candid. It''s nice to see people that can find good photos in the things they see, rather than having to create everything. Well done, I''m sad this didn''t place much higher.</td>', 'What? No comments? I''m very confused about the non-reaction to this photo. It''s decently in focus, composed well, and best of all -  a candid. It''s nice to see people that can find good photos in the things they see, rather than having to create everything. Well done, I''m sad this didn''t place much higher.', '2005-05-16 22:20:21.000000', NULL, 0),
