(1558705, 174592, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just ran across this in the "Vintage" gallery.  I like the focus alot.  The detail of the window and surround wood is nicely done. I love old buildings - they almost tell a story don''t they? Great use of lighting and the angle including the other window is GREAT! Good one.</td>', 'I just ran across this in the "Vintage" gallery.  I like the focus alot.  The detail of the window and surround wood is nicely done. I love old buildings - they almost tell a story don''t they? Great use of lighting and the angle including the other window is GREAT! Good one.', '2005-07-24 12:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
